# BAGLE — Cursor agent rules

## Shell and Python environment

Run **all** terminal commands (tests, installs, scripts, debugging) in the
**`py314`** conda environment
(`/Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314`). Do **not** use `astro` for this project.

Login shells may still activate `astro` via `~/.zshenv`; always switch to
`py314` before running Python.

### Preferred: login-interactive zsh, then activate `py314`

Non-interactive shells skip most of `~/.zshenv` (it returns when `PS1` is
empty). Use:

```bash
zsh -lic 'source /opt/miniforge3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate /Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314 && cd /Users/jlu/code/python/bagle && <your command>'
```

Examples:

```bash
zsh -lic 'source /opt/miniforge3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate /Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314 && cd /Users/jlu/code/python/bagle && PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests/test_jax_physics.py -q'
zsh -lic 'source /opt/miniforge3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate /Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314 && cd /Users/jlu/code/python/bagle && PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests/test_model.py -q'
```

### Alternative: call the env interpreter directly

```bash
zsh -lic 'cd /Users/jlu/code/python/bagle && PYTHONPATH=src /Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_jax_physics.py -q'
```

For `pip install`, prefer the activated env or:

```bash
/Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314/bin/python -m pip install <pkg>
```

### Explicit activation (if `zsh -lic` is unavailable)

```bash
export PATH="/opt/mambaforge3/bin:/opt/miniforge3/bin:$PATH"
source /opt/miniforge3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh
source /opt/miniforge3/etc/profile.d/mamba.sh
conda activate /Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314
export PARALLAX_CACHE_DIR="${HOME}/.bagle_parallax_cache/"
cd /Users/jlu/code/python/bagle
export PYTHONPATH="${PWD}/src:${PYTHONPATH}"
```

Do **not** use the system `/usr/bin/python3`, bare `pip3`, or the `astro`
env for this repo.

## This repository

- Package code lives under `src/bagle/`. For local runs and tests, prepend
  **`PYTHONPATH=src`** (in addition to any paths from `~/.zshenv`).
- JAX helpers and tests: `tests/test_jax_*.py`, `src/bagle/jax/`.
- **`bagle.model`** = NumPy reference (`origin/main`); **`bagle.model_jax`** =
  JAX implementation under test.
- Do not edit plan files in `.cursor/plans/` unless the user asks.

## Testing defaults

When verifying changes, prefer:

```bash
zsh -lic 'source /opt/miniforge3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate /Users/jlu/.conda/envs/py314 && cd /Users/jlu/code/python/bagle && PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests/test_jax_physics.py tests/test_jax_likelihood.py -q'
```

Run `tests/test_model.py` (NumPy reference) and `tests/test_model_jax.py`
(JAX model) after model or physics changes (slower; needs `py314` + full deps).
